      {
        "id": "tychus",
        "name": "Tychus"
      },
      {
        "id": "brightwing",
        "name": "Brightwing"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Sonya can be easily punished after engaging because she relies on the self-sustain from her Abilities and Talents. For this reason, Heroes that have crowd control and/or burst damage in their kit are a respectable threat for her.\n\nWrath of the Berserker only reduces the duration of Stun, Root, and Slow effects. As such, Heroes with access to Silence effects (including Taunt and Fear) are better for crowd controlling her."
  },
