    ],
    "explanation": "As a solid Offlaner capable of double soaking and clear Mercenary Camps with ease, Sonya can find a place on all Maps. She is, however, particularly effective on those Maps that feature several Mercenary Camps (for example Garden of Terror).\n\nDue to being relatively weak to ganks, Sonya struggles on Maps where it is easier to gank the enemy Offlaner (notably Towers of Doom)."
