    {
      "name": "Whirlwind Build",
      "label": "Situational",
      "description": "Sonya's Whirlwind Build excels against team compositions without reliable ways to interrupt Sonya during Whirlwind and ideally with multiple melee or low-range Heroes to hit at the same time, so that you will self-heal for more and thus be harder to kill.\n\nLife Funnel at Level 7 increases the healing Sonya receives from Whirlwind. Hurricane at Level 4 allows you to cast Whirlwind more often and, more importantly, gives you the ability to remove any Slow or Root from yourself.\n\nUse Whirlwind to heal yourself in lane or while fighting. Use either Nerves of Steel at Level 16 or Ignore Pain at Level 20 to reduce incoming burst damage while fighting.\n\nIf the enemy team has Heroes with high Attack Speed or multi-hit Basic Attacks, you should replace Tough As Nails at Level 1 with War Paint otherwise they will easily deplete all your Block charges.",
